{
  "title": "Nutty Crunchy Filipino Beetroot Tinola",
  "description": "A rich and crunchy Filipino dish featuring cooked beetroot and double-fry chicken, perfect for a weeknight dinner. This keto-friendly recipe is a twist on the traditional tinola dish.",
  "cuisine": "Filipino",
